## Exit criteria

- Normal pipeline CLI explicitly imports frozen local-only policy dispositions with a permitted policy labeller and method identity policy:local-evidence-abstention-v1. Native answer is absent; failed local attempts, decision hash/reference, concrete failure reason and proof gaps are preserved. No Qwen/Luna impersonation or fabricated reply.
