- Unassessed input quality is explicit and separate from model-assessed quality; actual empty abstract remains empty. All policy rows are bibliometric_only with rel_use_reason local_screen_abstention, including records with nonempty abstracts. Quality is not a fourth membership facet.
- Append-only normal imports refuse changed duplicate run keys and resume identical imports safely. View aligns exact policy provenance with effective ICF/dimension judgments and preserves uncertainty in chaining seed routes. Separate model-screened/guarded/policy counts support reproducible methods; no confirmed relevance/novelty claim or narrative use from abstention.
- Meaningful first-red tests verify honest policy identity, native absence, exact three scores, nonempty-abstract bibliometric restriction, source preservation, append guards and backward compatibility. Final populated padme full makecheck passes; diff≤14 content-bearing paths. No paid/model calls, prompt tuning, fresh audit or historical-waiver changes.

